&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Services Senior Project Manager (German Speaking)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Germany (Remote)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional Services (PS)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt; German Speaking.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rubrik Professional Services is looking for a high-energy, strategic, and results-driven Senior Project Manager to lead complex, enterprise customer implementations and help shape the future of our delivery practice. In this role, you will be customer-facing, acting as a trusted advisor to ensure deployment success, business value realisation, and operational efficiency. You will own high-stakes client engagements end-to-end, bringing deep project management expertise to solve problems on the ground and drive customer outcomes with minimal oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Senior Project Manager in our PS Organisation, you will drive impact primarily through hands-on delivery excellence, leadership, and practice enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1. Client Delivery Excellence&lt;br&gt;● Drive Complex Engagements: Lead end-to-end delivery of complex, concurrent, enterprise-level&amp;nbsp;customer projects from kickoff to sign-off within fast-paced environments.&lt;br&gt;● Scope &amp;amp; Milestone Management: Prepare enterprise customers for deployment, establish clear&amp;nbsp;success criteria, track deliverables, set targets, manage resources, and ensure project execution&amp;nbsp;adheres to deadlines and budgets.&lt;br&gt;● Risk &amp;amp; Issue Governance: Proactively identify, track, and mitigate project risks and technical&amp;nbsp;dependencies, resolving issues autonomously before they escalate.&lt;br&gt;● Stakeholder Alignment: Serve as the single point of contact and escalation owner for customer&amp;nbsp;executives, cross-functional internal teams (Engineering, Customer Support, Sales), and third-&amp;nbsp;party partners.&lt;br&gt;● Quality &amp;amp; Performance: Execute quality control throughout project lifecycles to ensure deliverables meet or exceed Rubrik&amp;amp;#39;s standards and customer business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2. PMO &amp;amp; Process Optimisation&lt;br&gt;● Partner with PS leadership to help build, refine, and maintain the PMO governance framework, including standard operating procedures, project methodologies, and key performance indicators.&lt;br&gt;● Continuous Improvement: Flag bottlenecks and recommend improvements that enhance&amp;nbsp;operational efficiency, margins, and customer satisfaction.&lt;br&gt;● Assist in establishing best practices for your engagements, resource allocation, utilisation tracking, and project health reporting across the PS portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● 8+ years of direct Project Management experience delivering customer-facing, enterprise technical projects within a Professional Services or Consulting organisation.&lt;br&gt;● Previous experience with managing customers from Financial Services, Government, Healthcare&amp;nbsp;industries&lt;br&gt;● Track record of managing multiple complex, high-visibility client engagements concurrently in a&amp;nbsp;fast-paced technology environment.&lt;br&gt;● Demonstrated ability to work autonomously, exercising strong judgment and decision-making in&amp;nbsp;ambiguous, high-pressure customer situations.&lt;br&gt;● Expert knowledge of modern project management tools (e.g., Smartsheet, Jira, Confluence,&amp;nbsp;Asana) as well as Google Workspace.&lt;br&gt;● Fluent written and spoken German and English skill is a must.&lt;br&gt;● Exceptional executive communication, stakeholder management, negotiation, and conflict&amp;nbsp;resolution skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to Have Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● Recognised credentials like Project Management Professional (PMP), PRINCE2, knowledge of Agile/Scrum (CSM, PMI-ACP), or Lean frameworks.&lt;br&gt;● Technical Background: Prior hands-on experience or foundational knowledge in Data&amp;nbsp;Management, Cloud Infrastructure (AWS, Azure, GCP), Data Protection, Enterprise Storage,&amp;nbsp;Cybersecurity, or SaaS delivery is a strong plus.&lt;br&gt;● Financial acumen regarding professional services metrics (e.g., revenue recognition, margin,&amp;nbsp;utilization, project profitability).&lt;br&gt;● Experience contributing to PMO governance practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rubrik Professional Services transforms possibilities into outcomes. Our portfolio of services uncovers&amp;nbsp;and exploits the unique opportunities made possible by Rubrik technology. Drawing on our unparalleled&amp;nbsp;product expertise and customer experiences, we collaborate with customers to identify and address&amp;nbsp;complex technical challenges, improve operational efficiency, and maximize their investment in Rubrik.&amp;nbsp;We are 100% focused on customer success, operational excellence, and empowering our team members&amp;nbsp;to grow, lead, and innovate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our roster has an opening with your name on it&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Product Manager &lt;/strong&gt;to join our &lt;strong&gt;Acquisitions &amp;amp; Onboarding team&lt;/strong&gt;, a domain that touches every customer who plays on FanDuel. You&#39;ll work closely with engineering and design to bring initiatives from scoping through delivery, while also contributing to the bigger questions of what we build and why — assessing opportunities, shaping priorities, and utilizing using data to inform decisions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; ensures successful product performance through market analysis, a deep understanding of customer needs, data analysis and reporting. Initiatives will be a mix of back-end and front-end work, with a focus on data recommendations, cutting edge technology and ease of use. There is a great opportunity to work across a range of expert teams to achieve your outcomes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition to the specific responsibilities outlined above, employees may be required to perform other such duties as assigned by the Company. This ensures operational flexibility and allows the Company to meet evolving business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE GAME PLAN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Everyone on our team has a part to play&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within a collaborative environment, liaising closely with an extensive list of stakeholders including engineering, marketing, commercial, design &amp;amp; product analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to product discovery and prioritization, helping assess opportunities and shape the roadmap alongside your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships across engineering, design, data, operations, and other stakeholders to drive alignment and remove blockers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track product performance and use data to identify what&#39;s working, what isn&#39;t, and what to do about it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop expertise in the onboarding domain and stay curious about how our product, customers, and landscape evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for eliciting requirements, in the form of user stories &amp;amp; acceptance criteria, prioritizing the product backlog to streamline the execution of program priorities while maintaining the conceptual and technical integrity of the features or components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain domain expertise including complex process flows and legal and regulatory requirements for our industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive through effective and sustainable change and guide the business through the journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play an integral role in a self-organizing agile delivery team, ensuring solutions adhere to state regulations for our products while serving the needs of each of our products (Sportsbook, Fantasy Sports, Predicts, Racing, and Casino).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and communicate the problem whilst putting the customers experience of the product first.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we’re looking for in our next teammate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years in a product management or product-adjacent role; prior PM title not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent numerical and analytical skills with the ability to interpret data quickly to inform the right decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with engineering and/or design teams, even in a supporting capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Naturally resourceful — you ask questions, seek out the right people, and find a path forward even when the answer isn&#39;t obvious&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and communication skills, with the ability to make sense of data and present your thinking clearly across different audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing priorities and working through ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Don’t check all the boxes? That’s okay! We encourage you to still apply if you feel like you possess an adjacent skill set and are interested in learning more about this position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Can Expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interesting work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - working in a fast-paced and ever-changing industry, new problems and exciting solutions are never too far away. There are always opportunities to learn new skills and broaden your horizons&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A sense of achievement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - Our teams own their own software and when that awesome new feature ships to users and the positive feedback starts rolling in, you can feel really proud of what you and your team created&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - clear and defined career pathways for every role at every level, a supportive manager, loads of learning opportunities and even 10% of your time to dedicate to your learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - everyone at FanDuel works for each other, we win together, make mistakes together and have lots of fun doing it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trust - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A trusting work environment where productivity is valued above all else, giving you autonomy and ownership of your time and work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great financial package &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Including salary, bonus, pension, private healthcare, share save scheme, flexible working &amp;amp; holiday policy along with a number of other benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FANDUEL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FanDuel Group is the premier mobile gaming company in the United States and Canada. FanDuel Group consists of a portfolio of leading brands across mobile wagering including: America’s #1 Sportsbook, FanDuel Sportsbook; its leading iGaming platform, FanDuel Casino; the industry’s unquestioned leader in horse racing and advance-deposit wagering, FanDuel Racing; and its daily fantasy sports product. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, FanDuel Group operates FanDuel TV, its broadly distributed linear cable television network and FanDuel TV+, its leading direct-to-consumer OTT platform. FanDuel Group has a presence across all 50 states, Canada, and Puerto Rico.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The company is based in New York with US offices in Los Angeles, Atlanta, and Jersey City, as well as global offices in Canada and Scotland. The company’s affiliates have offices worldwide, including in Ireland, Portugal, Romania, and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FanDuel Group is a subsidiary of Flutter Entertainment, the world&#39;s largest sports betting and gaming operator with a portfolio of globally recognized brands and traded on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE: FLUT).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;FanDuel is an equal opportunities employer. Diversity and inclusion in FanDuel means that we respect and value everyone as individuals. We don&#39;t tolerate bias, judgement or harassment. Our focus is on developing employees so that they reach their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;FanDuel is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities. If you have a disability and need a workplace accommodation or adjustment during the application and hiring process, including support for the interview or onboarding process, please email&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;ms-outlook-linkify&quot; ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The requirements listed in our job descriptions are guidelines, not hard and fast rules. You don’t have to satisfy every requirement or meet every qualification listed. If your skills are transferable and you are in the ballpark experience-wise, we&#39;d love to speak to you!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mirakl:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2012, Mirakl has been at the forefront of marketplace innovation, empowering every business to compete in the platform economy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, Mirakl’s operating system combines an enterprise marketplace solution (Mirakl Platform) that enables retailers and B2B organizations to launch, scale, and operate marketplaces and dropship, AI-powered multichannel selling (Mirakl Connect), retail media (Mirakl Ads) and an agentic commerce infrastructure (Mirakl Nexus).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With dual headquarters in Boston and Paris, Mirakl helps a global ecosystem of 450+ marketplaces (B2C and B2B) and a network of over 100k third-party marketplace sellers. Brands like Macy’s, Decathlon, Carrefour, Asos, and Airbus Helicopters use Mirakl to grow their businesses in new and remarkable ways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mirakl.com&quot;&gt;www.mirakl.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mirakl in Numbers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🗓️ Founded in 2012 | Member of French Tech Next40&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👥 750+ employees in 9 offices worldwide: Paris, Barcelona, Bordeaux, Boston, London, Munich, New York, Sydney, Tokyo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🇫🇷 350+ Mirakl Tech teams members mainly based in France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⚙️ 5 Saas Solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Mirakl means accelerating your career alongside ambitious, passionate, and supportive colleagues. We&#39;re proud of the diversity of backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences that make our teams unique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our 5 values guide how we collaborate:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💡&lt;strong&gt; Work Hard Together:&lt;/strong&gt; Teamwork and collaboration are the foundation of our success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏆 &lt;strong&gt;Get Things Done: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We prioritize action and efficiency for impactful results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Go Above &amp;amp; Beyond:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; We tackle challenges proactively and always aim for excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎓 &lt;strong&gt;Succeed Through Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge sharing and continuous learning are core to our culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 &lt;strong&gt;Satisfy &amp;amp; Empower Clients:&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re committed to our clients&#39; success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join the Product team within Mirakl Platform, working on the Catalog Management pillar.&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll work at the intersection of product, data, and AI: using AI to make our team faster, and helping design the AI agents our customers will use inside Mirakl.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a 6-month internship starting in January/February 2027. You&#39;ll participate in team rituals, gain autonomy quickly, and have the opportunity to present your work regularly to management, offering strong visibility within the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager Intern, you&#39;ll play a crucial role in driving data-driven decision-making across the product organization:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Senior Product Manager: Accompany product development end-to-end from discovery and ideation through delivery and go-to-market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and ship AI-automated workflows for PM day-to-day tasks. Examples: automating feedback triage and synthesis, release notes and changelogs, backlog grooming, meeting-to-ticket pipelines, KPI digests, and competitive monitoring. You&#39;ll own these workflows from identifying the pain point to measuring the hours saved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design of AI agents embedded in the Mirakl product. Work with the Senior Product Manager, Data Science, and Engineering to define customer-facing agent use cases for operators and sellers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore agentic commerce. Analyze how AI shopping and buying agents change discovery, catalog quality, pricing, and checkout on marketplaces. Map emerging standards and protocols, run small proofs of concept, and help shape product hypotheses and roadmap input&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive data analysis initiatives: Define problems, prepare and preprocess data, conduct statistical analyses, and validate results to support product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantify the impact of product releases: Measure and analyze the impact of new features and algorithmic changes through before/after analysis, sizing, hypothesis testing, and segmentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain performance dashboards: Create and maintain dashboards for your pillar and squads to track functional adoption and key performance indicators, including shared dashboards with Customer Success and Sales teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profile &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing a gap year internship, end-of-studies internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset with rigorous problem definition, logical reasoning, and structured thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid foundation in statistics including hypothesis testing, confidence intervals, and methodological choices for before/after impact analysis and group comparisons&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building automated workflows with tools such as n8n, Claude Cowork, or equivalents (Zapier, Make)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with a BI tool (Metabase or equivalent) and data visualization best practices is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge in exploratory data analysis and preprocessing (data cleaning, normalization, outlier management) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Soft Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, motivated, and proactive: You take initiative and seek out learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong team collaboration skills: Clear communication skills are essential to work effectively with cross-functional teams including Product, Data Science, Customer Success, and Sales stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast learner with adaptability: You have a strong desire to learn and can quickly adapt to new challenges in a dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Languages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very good level of English required (written and spoken)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monthly stipend range: €1,200 - €1,400&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We warmly encourage you to apply to this role, even if you think you&#39;re not an exact match.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please click the &quot;Apply&quot; button to submit your application. This helps us make the best possible assessment and get back to you as quickly as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manual screening of your CV by a recruiter and then an AI-powered screening conversation (10 min) with Emma, Mirakl’s AI Talent Ambassador to explore your background and motivation for the role. You will need to complete this step within 3 days, otherwise we won&#39;t be able to move forward with your application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TA interview (30-45 minutes) to discuss your experience and answer your questions about Mirakl&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hiring Manager interview (45 minutes) with one of the Product Managers to dive deeper into the role and assess technical fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;STAR interview (45 minutes) to evaluate alignment with our values and team culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We welcome collaborators with their diverse perspectives and experiences to power us forward. These often far exceed conventional job requirements and help us create a culture of continuous learning. If you’re ready to join a global leader powering digital transformation for 450+ of the world’s most innovative retailers and B2B organizations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
