&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Manual screening of your CV&lt;/strong&gt; by a recruiter, followed by an &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;AI-powered screening conversation (10 min)&lt;/strong&gt; with Emma, Mirakl&#39;s AI Talent Ambassador, to explore your background and motivation for the role. &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;You will need to complete this step within 3 days, otherwise we won&#39;t be able to move forward with your application.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
