&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Pallet &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Pallet is building AI Agents to transform the physical economy — a $12 trillion global industry. We’ve raised $50M from top investors, including General Catalyst, Bessemer Venture Partners, and Bain Capital Ventures. In under two years, we’ve achieved 700% revenue growth and are just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Our mission is to increase the efficiency of the global supply chain by automating the manual workflows that slow supply chain teams down — from scheduling and appointment setting to data entry and load management. Our flagship platform provides end-to-end visibility, control, and optimization, while our newest product, CoPallet, introduces AI Agents that can understand and execute requests in real time and integrate directly with customer systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;As companies across the physical economy look to generative AI to drive efficiency, many are turning to Pallet to lead the way. With deep supply chain expertise and cutting-edge AI capabilities, we’re positioned to build the next $10B company powering the physical economy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and work alongside leaders from Google, DoorDash, YC, and more to shape the future of supply chain technology.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;London, United Kingdom or Zurich, Switzerland (Remote to start, transitioning to 5 days/week in-office once our local office opens)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You could be an Enterprise Account Executive anywhere. Why us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a well-funded, high-growth startup on a clear path to $100M ARR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell a category-defining AI Agents platform with massive surface area across logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Pallet’s presence across Europe as one of the first commercial hires on the ground.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with founders and senior leadership to define our international go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help transform one of the world’s largest industries while building toward a $10B+ outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring our first Enterprise Account Executives in EMEA to build Pallet’s commercial presence across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own net-new enterprise acquisition across the region, build relationships with the largest logistics providers in Europe, and help establish the playbook for our international expansion. This is a highly consultative enterprise sales role focused on educating customers on an entirely new category of AI-powered workflow automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with Sales, Product, Engineering, Solutions, and Customer Success to drive a solution-selling motion centered around workflow discovery, AI use case identification, structured pilots, and measurable ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Initially, this role will be remote from London while we establish our UK presence. Once our London office opens, this role will transition to working from the office five days per week when not traveling to customer sites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you will make an impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full enterprise sales cycle across EMEA, from outbound prospecting through contract signature.&lt;/li&gt;
