&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-py-2 @md:s-leading-7 s-text-base s-leading-7 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;We warmly encourage you to apply to any of our roles, even if you think you&#39;re not an exact match.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-py-2 @md:s-leading-7 s-text-base s-leading-7 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Please click the &quot;Apply&quot; button to submit your application—this helps us make the best possible assessment and get back to you as quickly as possible.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-decimal s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Manuel screening of your CV &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;by a recruiter and then an &lt;strong&gt;AI-powered screening conversation&lt;/strong&gt; (10 min) with Emma, Mirakl’s AI Talent Ambassador to explore your background and motivation for the role. You will need to complete this step within 3 days, otherwise we won&#39;t be able to move forward with your application.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-decimal s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://vimeo.com/1073963262/5d76e579ef?fl=pl&amp;amp;fe=sh&quot;&gt;How to succeed in your interviews at Mirakl?&lt;span class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt; Watch the Video!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Intro Call&lt;/strong&gt;: Get to know each other with the recruiter, discuss your experience and answer your questions about Mirakl&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Business Interview&lt;/strong&gt;: Meet your future manager and a team member to discuss your experience and motivation using structured interviews (STAR method)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Welcome to Mirakl!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We welcome collaborators with their diverse perspectives and experiences to power us forward. These often far exceed conventional job requirements and help us create a culture of continuous learning. If you’re ready to join a global leader powering digital transformation for 450+ of the world’s most innovative retailers and B2B organizations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of our recruitment process, Mirakl processes your personal data to review and manage your application and, where appropriate, to consider your profile for future opportunities. You can exercise your data protection rights at any time, and as further detailed in our policies. For more information about how we process your personal data and your rights, please consult our Recruitment Privacy Notice, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in English and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/fr-FR/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in French.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We may use Artificial Intelligence (AI) solutions to help streamline our hiring process, including screening applications, analyzing resumes, and assessing responses. While AI helps us work efficiently, all final hiring decisions are made by humans. For more information, visit our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://info.mirakl.com/ai-guidelines-for-candidates-and-interviews&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI Guidelines for Candidates and Interviews&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The world’s most sophisticated companies rely on AlphaSense to remove uncertainty from decision-making. With market intelligence and search built on proven AI, AlphaSense delivers insights that matter from content you can trust. Our universe of public and private content includes equity research, company filings, event transcripts, expert calls, news, trade journals, and clients’ own research content. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The acquisition of Tegus by AlphaSense in 2024 advances our shared mission to empower professionals to make smarter decisions through AI-driven market intelligence. Together, AlphaSense and Tegus will accelerate growth, innovation, and content expansion, with complementary product and content capabilities that enable users to unearth even more comprehensive insights from thousands of content sets. Our platform is trusted by over 6,000 enterprise customers, including a majority of the S&amp;amp;P 500. Founded in 2011, AlphaSense is headquartered in New York City with more than 2,000 employees across the globe and offices in the U.S., U.K., Finland, India, Singapore, Canada, and Ireland. Come join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Expert Insights:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Expert Insights, which spans AlphaSense’s Expert Transcript Library and 1x1 Call Services offerings,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;delivers a new and transformative form of market intelligence content. Through transcripts covering thousands of companies, it captures the unfiltered views and insights of business operators in the trenches, interviewed by professional investors who drill into key questions on what’s truly important about a company at each moment in time. AlphaSense’s library of over 220,000 transcripts is the market’s largest, covering all sectors of the economy, with thousands more published each month. Expert Insights is quickly becoming a table-stakes solution for institutional investors to choose the right companies to invest in while gaining rapid adoption among all other consumers of market intelligence from sell-side research and banking, consultancies, and large corporations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Directed Content Team is an integral part of the Expert Insights group, generating thousands of calls each quarter on high-value and strategic content targets - ensuring that the AlphaSense Expert Transcript Library (ETL) delivers comprehensive coverage to our users. The Directed Content team is responsible for identifying, recruiting, and onboarding the best possible experts from around the world based on the targets and topics we are looking to generate content against - ensuring that the interviews with those experts are of the highest-possible quality and relevance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sector Lead on our TMT (Technology, Media and Telecoms) Directed Content team, you will play a pivotal role in ensuring AlphaSense delivers the highest-quality proprietary research content within your assigned sector. Reporting to the Director of Research (TMT) you will oversee the day-to-day execution of Directed Content projects, ensuring all work meets the firm’s standards for quality, relevance, and, end-user value delivery. As Sector Lead, you will manage coverage of EMEA and APAC companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will combine operational rigor with sector expertise to oversee a team of Project Managers responsible for generating expert call transcripts across a diverse range of topics within your coverage universe. Your responsibilities will span project setup, expert sourcing guidance, transcript quality assurance, budget oversight, and performance management. Acting as the connective layer between the Director of Research’s strategic vision and day-to-day execution, you will ensure flawless delivery of sector coverage plans while maintaining a pulse on emerging market themes and client information needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also serve as a key stakeholder in developing and optimizing project workflows, implementing structured QA and feedback loops, and partnering with Product and Operations teams to pilot new AI-enabled tools that elevate both efficiency and insight quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;the Director of Research to develop and maintain a strategic sector roadmap, which you will then translate into a structured execution plan, ensuring coverage aligns with key market and client priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and mentor a team of Project Managers that oversee the execution of Directed Content projects, setting clear goals, tracking KPIs, and ensuring accountability across all deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Operations Managers who oversee Analyst execution of expert recruiting, onboarding, and interaction facilitation to align operational KPIs to coverage strategy and optimize execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own expert budget management for your sector, allocating resources effectively to maximize content ROI while maintaining high quality and throughput.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee a structured QA process for ensuring transcripts within your sector of coverage meet the highest standards for data accuracy, relevance, structure, and analytical depth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the Director of Research and our Content Strategy Analyst to monitor engagement data, identify coverage gaps, and recalibrate project pipelines accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the Director of Research to identify and shape content to support revenue-generating efforts such as white papers, webinars, internal and external presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain feedback loops with call takers and project teams to enhance the quality and insight of future content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with North America directed content teams to ensure high quality output and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Operations and Product teams to pilot and optimize AI-enabled tools that improve project throughput, QA precision, and overall efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain deep familiarity with ongoing developments within the Healthcare, TMT or Energy &amp;amp; Industrial sectors, proactively surfacing new themes and companies to guide future research focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5–7 years of experience in equity research, market intelligence, consulting, or a related analytical role within TMT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring deep domain expertise in Technology, Media &amp;amp; Telecoms with a strong grasp of the key players, business models, and industry trends shaping your space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong understanding of European and Asian equity markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven people management experience, successfully leading, mentoring, and developing teams of project managers or analysts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are skilled at translating strategic objectives into actionable research projects that yield high-impact insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess exceptional organizational, analytical, and critical-thinking skills, able to balance multiple priorities with agility while maintaining high quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong command of project economics, capable of managing budgets, optimizing expert costs, and tracking ROI to ensure resource efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are adept at working cross-functionally with Directors of Research, Go-to-Market, Product, and Compliance to ensure alignment and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are intellectually curious, client-oriented, and comfortable operating in a fast-paced, dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You maintain a strong understanding of compliance, MNPI, and confidentiality standards across all project types.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences Principal, Business Development (EMEA), you will partner with EMEA Sales and Sales Engineering leaders to shape and execute the region’s HLS growth strategy. You will connect market opportunity to field execution: prioritizing segments and accounts, developing repeatable vertical and horizontal plays, strengthening the organization and partner ecosystem, and leading critical customer and alliance initiatives. You will be expected to operate comfortably at three levels:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Strategic: Define where and how Everpure should win in European healthcare and life sciences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Organizational: Build the capabilities, coverage, relationships, and operating cadence required to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Commercial: Personally advance priority opportunities, alliances, and executive relationships to closed business and measurable customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role requires a combination of HLS credibility, technical fluency in data and AI platforms, commercial ownership, and the ability to influence across country sales, SE, partners, and corporate teams without relying on formal authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Pipeline &amp;amp; Financial Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the booking targets and financial performance for the segment by developing and executing a multi year strategic growth plan. Drive and scale the overarching pipeline and bookings targets across the EMEA ecosystem, establishing clear qualification criteria and pipeline visibility.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define the EMEA Value Proposition:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Define and articulate the value proposition for Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences to drive growth and establish Everpure as the industry leader.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect &amp;amp; Execute Joint GTM Plans:&lt;/strong&gt; Author and launch strategic go-to-market plans with priority partners, aligning internal cross-functional EMEA teams (Partner Account Teams, Core Sales, Alliances, Marketing) to unlock high-potential HLS customer accounts and activate new revenue streams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate Strategic Alliances:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Orchestrate strategic vertical alliances and operationalize relationships with key partners to secure reference architectures and joint go to market motions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable and Mobilize the Partner Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Equip sales teams and partners with the specialized tools, training, and playbooks they need to successfully position and sell vertical solutions. Train and align Partner representatives ensuring they can effectively articulate our value proposition, economic differentiation, and technical sizing for healthcare compliance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Joint Demand Gen &amp;amp; Thought Leadership:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Act as a spokesperson for your vertical vision in customer meetings, industry events, analyst briefings, and media opportunities. Build credibility as a principal advisor by shaping the industry narrative around intelligent data foundations and enterprise AI adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HLS &amp;amp; Alliance Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven success leading strategic business development or alliance management within the technology sector, with a deep understanding of customers solutions, cloud economics, and the specific regulatory, data, and compliance needs of the EMEA Healthcare and Life Sciences sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Influence &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute the global strategy for your segment in partnership with Product Management, Sales, and Engineering teams. A track record of balancing high-level strategy with a &quot;roll-up-your-sleeves&quot; execution mindset, showing a strong ability to build trust and influence executive leaders across partner organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Collaboration &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding business acumen and communication skills, with a collaborative approach to thriving in a fast-paced, cross-functional, and multi-cultural EMEA environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location &amp;amp; Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; We operate in a hybrid/field-based model. You will be expected to work effectively from a regional corporate office in a key EMEA market, with the ability to travel 25–40% across the region as business needs require.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;734&quot; data-end=&quot;1060&quot;&gt;At OneStream, we&#39;re on a mission to empower every Finance organization and professional to exceed their potential. Our global teams span continents, cultures, and time zones, united by a shared purpose as we build the operating system for modern Finance and help organizations move with greater speed, clarity, and confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1065&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;That mission comes to life through our people. Behind every innovation, customer success, and milestone are talented people working together to make a difference. &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;That&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;we&#39;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;looking for people who are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;bold enough to think big, authentic in how they lead and collaborate, curious about&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;what&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;possible, and committed to delivering results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1065&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Want a closer look before you apply? Explore our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.onestream.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Careers site&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our people, culture, and benefits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OneStream, we&#39;re building the AI Operating System for Modern Finance. As the only enterprise finance platform that unifies financial and operational data, embeds AI, and extends to meet changing business needs, we&#39;re empowering some of the world&#39;s leading organisations to Take Finance Further. We believe finance leaders need more than traditional Corporate Performance Management (CPM) tools. They need a single, intelligent platform that drives productivity, enables better decisions, and delivers measurable business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Customer Success Manager (CSM), you will play a critical role in helping customers achieve their business goals and maximise the value of their OneStream investment. Acting as a strategic advisor, trusted partner, and primary customer advocate, you will guide customers throughout their journey and beyond, from onboarding and adoption to value realisation, expansion, renewal, and long-term success. By leveraging data-driven insights, AI-powered capabilities, and a consultative, human-centred approach, you will build strong relationships with key stakeholders, understand their unique objectives, and deliver measurable business outcomes that drive retention, growth, and advocacy. Working cross-functionally to unlock the full value of OneStream&#39;s capabilities, you will ensure customers not only realise lasting value from their investment but become enthusiastic champions, advocates, and references for our platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position will manage approximately 60 Tier 3 Accounts across EMEA, with the majority of accounts based in France. Fluent English and French are required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is posted as Remote (home-based) in France; however, the successful candidate is expected to prefer a Hybrid working arrangement, splitting time between home office work and 1–2 days per week in the Paris office (located in the Levallois-Perret district) to build stronger in-person collaboration with colleagues, with the opportunity for occasional customer visits as they arise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary Duties and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Managing your portfolio of customers&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;• Partner with sales to complete a comprehensive sales transition process. &lt;br&gt;• Operate as a business partner to your customer and their delivery team by knowing their strategy and plan. &lt;br&gt;• Primary ownership and accountability for driving your customer’s adoption, expansion, satisfaction, and renewal. &lt;br&gt;• Understand customer’s OneStream contractual agreements (Cloud/SaaS, Term, etc.) &lt;br&gt;• Understand customer’s contractual agreements with their delivery team whether it is with a Partner or with OneStream Services (Scope, Timeline, staffing). &lt;br&gt;• Manage and execute the customer’s onboarding process. &lt;br&gt;• Develop strong working relationships with your customers and their delivery team. &lt;br&gt;• Establish and execute cadence-based “Business Review” meetings with your customer. &lt;br&gt;• Identify and mitigate risks that threaten your customer’s satisfaction, growth, or renewal. &lt;br&gt;• Align with Customer Success leadership on regional metrics. &lt;br&gt;• Develop and grow your knowledge of OneStream’s Platform and MarketPlace Solutions and share that knowledge with customers. &lt;br&gt;• Promote awareness of Regional OneStream Communities and customer educational events. &lt;br&gt;• Keep management informed of progress and obstacles on your portfolio of customers. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Advocacy&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Learn and understand what customers value in their partnership with OneStream. &lt;br&gt;• Actively listen to customers and help them understand how they can get the most value from their investment in OneStream. &lt;br&gt;• Champion your customer’s requests by collaborating with the Customer, their delivery team and various OneStream departments (Customer Support, Cloud, Technical SME’s, Product Mgmt. etc.). &lt;br&gt;• When necessary, be the respectful challenger to set and manage your customer’s expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Education and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Experience: Minimum of 5 years overall.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Success Expertise: At least 3 years in a Customer Success role within a SaaS technology company, supporting solutions primarily used by Finance or IT departments and engaging with senior decision-makers such as CFOs, CIOs, CTOs or CISOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Outcome Management: Demonstrated ability to keep customers focused on achieving their desired business outcomes throughout their initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationship Management: Proven experience in building and managing strong customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finance Process Knowledge: Conceptual understanding of key finance processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to speak both French and English at at least Business Level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Education and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education: Degree in Business, Accounting, Finance, Information Technology, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationship Management: Proven experience in building and managing strong customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting Background: Experience in management consulting or technology consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Corporate Performance Management (CPM): Hands-on experience as a Customer Success Manager or in a customer facing position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CPM Software Expertise: Prior experience with one or more of the following: OneStream, Oracle EPM Suite (HFM, FCCS, PBCS, Planning, Essbase, FDM, etc.), SAP BPC (Outlooksoft), SAP BOFC (Cartesis),IBM Cognos, Anaplan Other CPM solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
